# ==============================================================================
# Sarvam AI Translation Configuration
# Reference: https://github.com/mugdhav/SarvamAPICodeSample.git
# Official Docs: https://docs.sarvam.ai/
# ==============================================================================

# Your Sarvam AI API subscription key from https://dashboard.sarvam.ai/
SARVAM_API_KEY=your_sarvam_api_key_here

# API Endpoint: https://api.sarvam.ai/translate
# Supported Indian Languages: English (en-IN), Telugu (te-IN), Hindi (hi-IN) + 20 others
# Supported Models:
#   - mayura:v1 (Context-rich, conversational & deep Indian translation, up to 1,000 chars)
#   - sarvam-translate:v1 (Formal style translation, up to 2,000 chars)
# Pricing: ₹2.00 per 1,000 characters (Pay-as-you-go)
